{
    "title": "Aeries Mobile Portal",
    "description": "Now parents and students can take their student information with them on-the-go, with the first version of the Aeries Mobile Portal app for parents and students!\r\n\r\nPut your Aeries student data in your pocket with Aeries Mobile Portal. Check gradebook details, review attendance, and access Aeries Communications - right from the palm of your hand!\r\n\r\n\u2022 Gradebook summary and gradebook details\r\n\u2022 Attendance including tardies and absences\r\n\u2022 Student contact information\r\n\u2022 QR code Supplemental Attendance check-in scanner\r\n\u2022 In-app access to your Aeries Communications portal (if enabled at your district)\r\n\u2022 Financial information available\r\n\u2022 Report Cards\r\n\u2022 State Test Reports\r\n\r\nImportant - please note you can only utilize this app if your school district is using the Aeries Student Information System. Contact your school for more information regarding compatibility with the Aeries Mobile Portal app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Now parents and students can take their student information with them on-the-go, with the first version of the Aeries Mobile Portal app for parents and students!<br><br>Put your Aeries student data in your pocket with Aeries Mobile Portal. Check gradebook details, review attendance, and access Aeries Communications - right from the palm of your hand!<br><br>\u2022 Gradebook summary and gradebook details<br>\u2022 Attendance including tardies and absences<br>\u2022 Student contact information<br>\u2022 QR code Supplemental Attendance check-in scanner<br>\u2022 In-app access to your Aeries Communications portal (if enabled at your district)<br>\u2022 Financial information available<br>\u2022 Report Cards<br>\u2022 State Test Reports<br><br>Important - please note you can only utilize this app if your school district is using the Aeries Student Information System. Contact your school for more information regarding compatibility with the Aeries Mobile Portal app.",
